 f4a2f77d3ce682ed71486f798703da8a87e440c6560bddbc20e5635d6558130a0f67aff193453d8ae1fe1078245b9d4ab97b5c3217d997680d38050657e28e0a  0166-power-supply-qcom_pm8150b-charge-by-the-fuel-gauge-l.patch
